{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56632","headline":"甘州乐 · 无名氏","name":"甘州乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"燕路霸山远，胡关易水寒。\n茫茫风藻动，浍浍阳只闲。\n残月芦江白，老花菊岸[丹]（舟）。\n竹惊暖露冷，落叶寒飈阑。\n（见日本《古事类苑》「唐乐乐曲甘州第四帖」辞。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56632.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56632","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}